'''''Hornungia petraea''''' (also ''Hutchinsia petraea'') is a small [[flowering plant]] in the family [[Brassicaceae]]. It is native to Europe and parts of North Africa and the Middle East.<ref>{{cite web |title=Hornungia petraea (L.) Rchb. |url=https://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:285375-1 |website=Plants of the World Online |access-date=25 January 2024 |language=en}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://brassibase.cos.uni-heidelberg.de/?action=search&subaction=tax&param1=Hornungia%20petraea|title=Tribe Descurainieae Al-Shehbaz|work=Brassibase|accessdate=5 March 2020}}</ref>

